      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "RACCOON ROGER (1) goes very well this trip starting eight times for three wins and three minors. Comes off a (28.79) win last time, scoring by 1.5 lengths in a Grade 4/5 over 498m at this track. With a clean break looks hard to beat. CANYA WOW ME (7) was quickly into stride and burnt early from out wide where he gave a sight, finishing third (30.10) and beaten 6 lengths over 510m at Rockhampton. The form from his last run is stacking up nicely. Leading player again. MISS ROSALEA (3) broke from a low draw and filled a minor placing last start, beaten only 1.5 lengths (22.19) behind Smoking Ace at this track. Remains without a win from the draw but has been in the placings three times from five attempts. Leading chance. VALEENA BOY (2) can improve on an unplaced run here last time out.",
